        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalesosikhathi uMerodakiBaladani, indodana kaBaladani inkosi yaseBabiloni, wathumela izithunywa zilezincwadi lesipho kuHezekiya, ngoba wayezwile ukuthi ubekade egula, usesilile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.20.12+2KI.20.13+2KI.20.14+2KI.20.15+2KI.20.16+2KI.20.17+2KI.20.18+2KI.20.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kho 20:12–19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UHezekiya wazamukela, wazitshengisa yonke indlu yakhe yenotho, isiliva legolide, lamakha lamafutha amahle, lezikhali zakhe, lakho konke okwakukhona ezindlini zakhe zokugcina impahla; kakubanga khona lokukodwa endlini yakhe lakuwo wonke umbuso wakhe angazitshengisanga khona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UIsaya umprofethi wasesiya enkosini uHezekiya, wathi kuyo: Batheni lababantu na? Futhi bebevela ngaphi? UHezekiya wathi: Bafikile kimi bevela elizweni elikhatshana, kwelaseBabiloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UIsaya wasesithi: Baboneni endlini yakho na? UHezekiya waphendula wathi: Babone konke okukhona endlini yami; kakulalutho ezindlini zami zokugcina impahla engingabatshengisanga lona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UIsaya wasesithi kuHezekiya: Zwanake ilizwi leNkosi yamabandla, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uthi: Insuku ziyeza lapho konke okusendlini yakho, lalokho konke okhokho bakho abakugcinayo kuze kube lamhla, kuzathwalelwa eBabiloni, kakuyikusala lutho, kutsho iNkosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 39:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amanye amadodana akho owazeleyo azakuthunjwa, abe ngabathenwa esigodlweni senkosi yaseBabiloni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.39.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.39.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
